{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21938","headline":"杂兴三首 一 · 白居易","name":"杂兴三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚王多内宠，倾国选嫔妃。\n又爱从禽乐，驰骋每相随。\n锦韝臂花隼，罗袂控金羁。\n遂习宫中女，皆如马上儿。\n色禽合爲荒，刑政两已衰。\n云梦春仍猎，章华夜不归。\n东风二月天，春雁正离离。\n美人挟银镝，一发叠双飞。\n飞鸿惊断行，敛翅避蛾眉。\n君王顾之笑，弓箭生光辉。\n回眸语君曰，昔闻庄王时。\n有一愚夫人，其名曰樊姬。\n不有此游乐，三载断鲜肥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}